    "Add red wine and beef broth, scraping up browned bits from bottom of pot.",
    "Add tomato paste, bay leaves, thyme, and pungent. Stir to combine.",
    "Return lamb to pot and bring to a boil.",
    "Cover pot and transfer to preheated oven.",
